1
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:05,300
Everyone begins by holding on.

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,800
Then someone teaches you to let go.

3
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,600
For a while, one line was enough for two.

4
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,300
Sometimes the line stops.

5
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,600
And then it goes on.

6
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:42,400
Your turn now.
